    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">fetchpriority</code> support for the foillowing SVG elements:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;feimage&gt;</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;image&gt;</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;script&gt;</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox is the first browser to support this feature, I have tested in:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 140</li>\n<li>Firefox nightly 141.0a1 (2025-06-17)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested with the following code pens:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/jEPpowN\" rel=\"nofollow\">svg feimage element priority</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/KwpBYYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">svg image element priority</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cdpn.io/pen/debug/YPXjWwb\" rel=\"nofollow\">SVG Script priority</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1847712\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bugzill issue #1847712</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li>Firefox Release note coming soon</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27090",
            "title": "Firefox 140 beta adds `fetchpriority` for some SVG elements",
