        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mentions that Firefox/Safari recognize the <code class=\"notranslate\">avoid</code> value for the <code class=\"notranslate\">break-before/after</code> CSS properties, but it has no effect.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Relates to: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2210848614\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22723\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22723/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/22723\">#22723</a></li>\n<li>Follow up to: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3150440359\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27073\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27073/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27073\">#27073</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27085",
            "title": "Firefox/Safari parse `break-before/after: avoid` without effect",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-17T11:56:48.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-17T11:55:54.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "caugner",
