        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214958514?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR comes from this issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3143219207\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050\">#27050</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried to add understandable explanation of the issue to the notes to.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are provided in the issue, but in short, it seems that Chrome (and Safari apparently) accept the angles supplied for <code class=\"notranslate\">font-style: oblique</code>, but don't really properly use them. Certain degrees seem to fall back to <code class=\"notranslate\">font-style: italic</code> while others seem to fall back to <code class=\"notranslate\">font-style: normal</code>. Meanwhile, in stark contrast, Firefox supports the full degree range from -90 to 90.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27050.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3143219207\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27050\">#27050</a>, more or less.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27083",
            "title": "Updating `font-style: oblique` details for Chrome and Safari",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-17T17:19:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-17T11:37:46.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ronikarjalainen",
                "url": "https://github.com/ronikarjalainen"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add the BCD information in support of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1888486\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1888486</a> browser.i18n.getPreferredSystemLanguages()</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and PRs</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related MDN content changes and release notes in PR TBC.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27075",
            "title": "Bug-1888486 add webextension.api.i18n.getPreferredSystemLanguages",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-18T02:30:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-17T02:41:34.000Z",
